   - **Public Publisher Profile (`PublisherConsolePage.tsx`)**: Filtered apps via literal string matching against `publisherName`. As a result, navigating to the publisher profile from an app with `developer: "Sahanur Molla"` (e.g. NOTE) displayed exclusively that single app, hiding the other 9 apps created under "Sahinur Molla".
3. **Identity & Support Details Lost on Logout**:
