## 19. Unified Real-Time Notification & Milestone Dispatch Engine

### Architectural Objective
Expand the real-time notification system (synchronized across Firestore In-App Notification Centre and Native Phone/Lockscreen Alerts) to encompass every critical lifecycle event across the platform:
1. **Unbanning & Access Restoration**:
   - Immediate notification when an administrator unbans an application (`notifyPublisherAppAction`), unbans a developer GitHub profile or release link (`notifyUserUnbanned`), or lifts account restrictions (`notifyPublisherRestrictionAction`).
2. **Publisher Milestone Achievements**:
   - Automated detection when an application surpasses download milestones: **10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500, 1,000, 5,000, 10,000, 50,000, 100,000+ downloads**.
   - Triggers `notifyPublisherDownloadMilestone` with celebration emojis, tailored badges, and direct navigation links to the Publisher Console.
3. **Review & Rating Interactions**:
   - **New Review**: Immediate alert to the app's publisher when a user leaves a rating and review (`notifyPublisherNewReview`).
   - **Updated Review**: Alert to the publisher when a user edits their rating or feedback (`notifyPublisherReviewUpdated`).
   - **Publisher Reply**: Dedicated notification to the individual review author when the verified publisher responds (`notifyUserReviewReply`).
   - **Helpful Feedback**: Notification to the reviewer when other users mark their review as helpful (`notifyUserReviewHelpful`).

### Milestone Tracking & Deduplication Algorithm
To prevent duplicate milestone notifications from firing on subsequent app visits or download checks:
- A milestone tracker persists an array of triggered thresholds in `localStorage` under the key:
  `prople_notified_milestones_${appId}`
- Before dispatching a milestone notification:
  $$\text{EligibleMilestones} = \{ M \in \text{MILESTONES} \mid \text{downloadsCount} \ge M \land M \notin \text{NotifiedSet} \}$$
- The highest un-notified milestone is triggered, and `NotifiedSet` is atomically updated and saved.
- This ensures developers receive celebratory milestone alerts exactly once per threshold without spamming.

### Real-Time Flow Matrix

| Event | Initiator | Recipient | Firestore Category | Native Phone Alert | Action Target |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **App Unbanned** | Admin | Publisher | `moderation` | Yes | App Detail / Console |
| **Profile/Link Unbanned** | Admin | User / Publisher | `moderation` | Yes | App Detail / Profile |
| **Restriction Lifted** | Admin | Publisher | `moderation` | Yes | Publisher Console |
| **Download Milestone (e.g. 100)** | Scheduler / Install | Publisher | `publisher` | Yes | Publisher Console |
| **Verified Download (+1)** | Scheduler / Install | Publisher | `publisher` | Yes | App Detail |
| **New Review** | Reviewer | Publisher | `review` | Yes | App Reviews / Reply |
| **Review Updated** | Reviewer | Publisher | `review` | Yes | App Reviews / Reply |
| **Publisher Reply** | Publisher | Review Author | `review` | Yes | App Reviews |
| **Review Upvoted Helpful** | Community User | Review Author | `review` | Yes | App Reviews |
| **Direct Notice (Targeted)** | Admin | Specified Account Email/UID | `moderation` / `announcement` | Yes (Recipient only) | Deep Link / Custom Action |
| **Global Broadcast** | Admin | All Platform Users | `announcement` / `global_notice` | Yes (All active devices) | Custom Action URL |

