## 26. Responsive App Preview Scaling & Aspect-Ratio Preservation

### 1. Dimension Preservation Protocol
To provide a more immersive preview experience matching native Google Play Store proportions without warping graphic assets:
- **Aspect Ratio Locking**:
  - Promo Trailers & YouTube previews: strictly locked to `aspectRatio: '16 / 9'`.
  - Portrait Mobile Screenshots: locked to `aspectRatio: '9 / 16'` with `object-cover object-top`.
