  - Medium Viewports (md): `h-[250px]`
  - Desktop (lg): `h-[275px]`
- **Zero Distortions**: By utilizing dynamic CSS `aspectRatio` together with `h-[...] w-auto shrink-0`, widths automatically expand proportionately to height changes without horizontal or vertical stretching.

