## 46. Universal Platform & File-Type Button Clarification Architecture

### Objective
Eliminate user confusion regarding cross-platform releases and installer types by explicitly displaying the target platform and precise package format on all primary action and download buttons across the store (e.g., `Download Mac DMG`, `Download Windows EXE`, `Download Linux AppImage`, `Install APK`).

