   - **Windows Apps**: `Download Windows ${ext}` (e.g., `Download Windows EXE`, `Download Windows MSI`).
   - **Linux Apps**: `Download Linux ${ext}` (e.g., `Download Linux AppImage`, `Download Linux DEB`).
