Completely eliminate hardcoded/mock data fallbacks across `AppDetailPage`, `AboutAppPage`, and `DataSafetyPage`, replacing them with developer-declared real metadata managed directly via the Publisher Console (`AppConsole.tsx`), synced to Firestore, and transparently surfaced to Google SEO and Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) agents.

### Core Architectural Principles
